- install the core plus the internal overlay;
- pull core updates cleanly, via releases, a package, or an upstream remote;
- never have to merge private ", "idempotency_key": "opt-2026-11-15-decouple-core", "title": "Decouple public core from company-internal integrations (plugin structure, update channel)"}
